	affiliations = {Sathyabama Institute of Science and Technology, Chennai, India},
	abstract = {The Voice-Controlled Smart Programming Assistant revolutionizes software development by enabling hands-free coding, debugging, and optimization through natural language processing (NLP) and machine learning (ML). This intelligent assistant adapts to individual coding styles, supports multiple programming languages, and seamlessly integrates with popular Integrated Development Environments (IDEs) such as Visual Studio Code and PyCharm. The system achieves an average voice recognition accuracy of 93%, a debugging success rate of 90%, and code generation accuracy of 85%, significantly reducing coding time and cognitive load. Through real-time error detection, personalized suggestions, and collaborative features, it enhances productivity and accessibility for developers at all skill levels. Additionally, the system is designed to support individual developers and teams by enabling real-time code sharing and adaptive learning. While challenges such as handling ambiguous commands and background noise interference remain, future enhancements will focus on improving contextual understanding, expanding multilingual support, and optimizing response times. By redefining programming workflows, this assistant paves the way for a more efficient, inclusive, and intelligent software development experience  © 2025 IEEE.},
