	abstract = {Software development is experiencing a significant transformation driven by Artificial Intelligence. The demand for high-quality software is ever-growing. Traditional software development can be time-consuming, often bottlenecked by repetitive tasks and the need to write vast amounts of code. Artificial Intelligence (AI) offers a revolutionary approach to code creation. This study dives into the exciting world of the AI-powered code era, exploring how gears like Open AI's GPT can automate various degrees of the software program improvement procedure. The study reveals how AI can extensively pace things by comparing AI-generated code to standard manual coding and other computerized methods. The research emphasizes the need for a considerate approach, thinking about the strengths and weaknesses of different AI algorithms, and highlights AI's immense potential to reshape the entire field of software program engineering. The research concludes by exploring the broader implications, demanding situations, and thrilling future guidelines for AI to make software development even more efficient.  © 2024 IEEE.},
